{"id":"n69121-1-7","stage":5,"title":"외식비 · 餐费","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69121-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 물가가 올라서 외식비도 좀 부담스러워.","zh":"最近物价上涨，外出吃饭的开销也变得有点负担了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물가가","meaning":"物价","explanation":"물가：物价；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물가","audio":"/audio/f4d16c8379abbc0f64e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15416","senseId":"1","lemma":"물가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라서","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외식비도","meaning":"餐费","explanation":"외식비：餐费；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"외식비","audio":"/audio/cbb5402f01d656da8549.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69121","senseId":"1","lemma":"외식비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부담스러워.","meaning":"有压力，有负担，别扭，不自在","explanation":"부담스럽다：有压力，有负担，别扭，不自在；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"부담스럽다","audio":"/audio/3d61cf57e6da404da30b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60139","senseId":"1","lemma":"부담스럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"f4d16c8379abbc0f","term":"물가","zh":"物价","audio":"/audio/f4d16c8379abbc0f64e9.mp3","entryId":"15416","definition":"东西或服务的平均价格。","pronunciation":["물까"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]},{"id":"cbb5402f01d656da","term":"외식비","zh":"餐费","audio":"/audio/cbb5402f01d656da8549.mp3","entryId":"69121","definition":"在家外面买饭花费的钱。","pronunciation":["외ː식삐","웨ː식삐"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"3d61cf57e6da404d","term":"부담스럽다","zh":"有压力，有负担，别扭，不自在","audio":"/audio/3d61cf57e6da404da30b.mp3","entryId":"60139","definition":"感觉某事或某状况很难承受。","pronunciation":["부ː담스럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2df9c0a3c3bc733aba1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69121-1-7-2","ko":"그래서 나는 도시락을 싸 가지고 다닐까 생각 중이야.","zh":"所以我在考虑带便当过去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도시락을","meaning":"盒饭","explanation":"도시락：盒饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"도시락","audio":"/audio/82a2218a0f6320f1ceeb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47599","senseId":"2","lemma":"도시락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸","meaning":"装，打包","explanation":"싸다：装，打包；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65049","senseId":"3","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"持，带，戴","explanation":"가지다：持，带，戴；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다닐까","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；ㄹ까：表达犹豫、推测或考虑，连接 보다、하다 等后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중이야.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"82a2218a0f6320f1","term":"도시락","zh":"盒饭","audio":"/audio/82a2218a0f6320f1ceeb.mp3","entryId":"47599","definition":"可解决在户外吃饭问题的装在小器皿里的食物。","pronunciation":["도시락"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"装，打包","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"65049","definition":"为了将某个东西运往别处而用箱子、绳子或布等包起来。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"持，带，戴","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"手里握着或身上携带着某物。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","d